/* Settings → Recording audio source */
"Web meetings such as Google Meet are recorded through the browser that runs them, including all its tabs." = "Web-Meetings wie Google Meet werden über den Browser aufgenommen, in dem sie laufen, einschließlich aller seiner Tabs.";

